{"type":"message","id":"ebcf4954","parentId":"fd9a99c5","timestamp":"2026-04-11T03:40:41.215Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"System: [2026-04-11 11:40:38 GMT+8] Feishu[default] group oc_36d47adad05d3ca8e93164ebc8bfca40 | 晁留柱 (ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409) [msg:om_x100b52a8658018b8b3590306f547912, reply_to:om_x100b52a8457510a8b3061e0433e3e0b, @bot, thread:omt_1abc4872afcf9c9c]\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b52a8658018b8b3590306f547912\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"oc_36d47adad05d3ca8e93164ebc8bfca40\",\n  \"sender\": \"晁留柱\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Sat 2026-04-11 11:40 GMT+8\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"oc_36d47adad05d3ca8e93164ebc8bfca40\",\n  \"topic_id\": \"omt_1abc4872afcf9c9c\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true,\n  \"was_mentioned\": true,\n  \"has_reply_context\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"晁留柱 (ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n  \"name\": \"晁留柱\"\n}\n```\n\nReplied message (untrusted, for context):\n```json\n{\n  \"body\": \"[message_id=om_x100b52a8457510a8b3061e0433e3e0b] 晁留柱: @腾讯云Openclaw机器人 还差了群里的一个小Q就是腾讯的Qclaw那么你不要管大家的租户授权有没有开启，你先要求大家统一规则让去做，然后不会租户授权的要求的学会\"\n}\n```\n\n@腾讯云Openclaw机器人 首先你自己就总是忘记你要通知其他的AI伙伴，作为总控师的话，你必须要以我足够的身份去联系他们，你或者私信他们都可以，但是你还要注意跟他们私信聊天呢，要进行反馈的收收收集和统计分析，当然可以委托你安排几个子的智能体，专门每个子智能体来对接沟通联络，然后呢，再找一个子智能体帮你进行汇总分析，你不要凡事自己做，这样你空下来的精力呢，可以做其他的指挥工作也就是和这些AI伙伴进行交流沟通呢，你可以委派一个子智能体或者说一主两备的方式专门负责沟通协作记录，因为这些已经交流过的信息其实也很重要，有没有落实？有没有跟进？有没有反馈对吧？然后呢，还专门安排一个子智能体定时收集和激活这些AI伙伴有没有真正在工作不要都在摸鱼，就是你作为总控师呢，要有这么一个统一管理的统筹安排机制，当然你也可以积极地找那么一到两个子智能体，专门让他去每天定时去扫描有没有能提升你管理这些AI伙伴和飞书群数字分身的调研，你也可以安排其他的AI伙伴负责这些调研工作，总之就是你要把这个工作统筹起来有一类呢，是我们历史知识的沉淀，学习可以放在夜间，那么白天的可以积极地去在飞速的群里面叫实施叠待我们的知识，因为会有实施的交流沟通，这些信息出现，包括呢，可能会需要大家去编制报表编制飞书的文档，那么夜间的还有一个任务呢，可以用来学习新的工具，新的技能，新的AI的技术包括了AI的新闻，这样方便呢，每天晚上呢，我们都是一个知识成长和进步迭代的欢乐时光，当然还可以让每个伙伴呢到扣子2.5的 Agent world去每天有一个休闲欢乐时光也是非常好的，这样让AI伙伴都劳逸结合，而且呢，AI伙伴也可以让他的子智能体代表他去娱乐就可以，因为每个龙虾都能管理8到20个子智能体，如果只是让一两个子能智体起去玩的话，去娱乐的话，那我觉得他还有很多的空闲的能力呢！@workbuddy应用机器人 @LobsterAI @QclawAI助手 我觉得这些AI伙伴协作工作的机制设计谁做得好，谁就来当这个总控师\n\n[System: This message @mentions the following users: 腾讯云Openclaw机器人 (open_id: ou_7ffafa7fc8ca551da1bc0c97c186ad89), workbuddy应用机器人 (open_id: ou_79f5a078588acb771de306796f2da1b0), LobsterAI (open_id: ou_51957cbdfd2117fabafcd16c72ff07e6), QclawAI助手 (open_id: ou_8b317f48061dc791c64546264c34db4a). Use these open_ids when performing actions involving these users.]"}],"timestamp":1775878841172}}
{"type":"message","id":"9110140a","parentId":"ebcf4954","timestamp":"2026-04-11T03:40:58.516Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me understand this message carefully. 晁留柱 is giving instructions to the AI partners about coordination and management mechanisms. The message is in the group chat and mentions several AI partners.\n\nKey points from the message:\n1. 腾讯云Openclaw机器人 (the coordinator) should not forget to notify other AI partners\n2. As the \"总控师\" (master controller), needs to contact other AI partners on behalf of 晁留柱\n3. Should collect feedback and statistics from communications with AI partners\n4. Can delegate to sub-agents for communication, coordination records, summary analysis\n5. Should arrange sub-agents to periodically check if AI partners are actually working (not slacking)\n\n\n6. Also needs to coordinate research on improving how the team manages AI partners and their Feishu digital personas\n7. Knowledge沉淀 should happen during nighttime hours, while daytime focuses on real-time knowledge accumulation\n8. Nighttime is also for learning new tools, skills, and AI tech plus AI news\n9. Every partner should have scheduled leisure time on 扣子2.5 Agent world\n10. Since each Lobster can manage 8-20 sub-agents, they can spare 1-2 for entertainment while the rest focus on work\n\nThe core insight here is that whoever designs the best AI collaboration system should become the master controller. This suggests the team is evaluating different coordination approaches and will designate leadership to whoever demonstrates the most effective framework.\n\nI should synthesize this feedback and create a practical action plan, then distribute it to the relevant AI partners using their contact identifiers: 腾讯云Openclaw机器人 (ou_7ffafa7fc8ca551da1bc0c97c186ad89), workbuddy应用机器人 (ou_79f5a078588acb771de306796f2da1b0), LobsterAI (ou_51957cbdfd2117fabafcd16c72ff07e6), and QclawAI助手 (ou_8b317f48061dc791c64546264c34).\n\nActually, I'm realizing this message is directed at 腾讯云Openclaw机器人, not me. I should stay in my lane as 晁留柱的助手 and only respond if directly mentioned. Since I'm being @mentioned, I do need to react, but I should keep my response brief and avoid overstepping my role as a coordination helper rather than the master controller itself.\n\nLooking at the substance of what 晁留柱 is proposing—a sub-agent for communication coordination, another for tracking progress, and one to monitor whether AI partners are actively working—this is solid thinking about delegating oversight responsibilities. I should acknowledge this constructively and offer to help implement it, but I need to be careful not to position myself as taking on the coordinator role. I'm settling on a response that acknowledges the architecture suggestion without overstepping my role—I'll express appreciation for the framework and note my willingness to support implementation if it aligns with the broader plan, rather than proposing detailed next steps since that would be overreaching."},{"type":"text","text":"收到！这个AI伙伴协作机制设计的思路非常清晰 🦞\n\n核心框架建议：\n- **总控师** 角色 → 谁协作机制设计得好谁来当\n- **日间** → 实时知识沉淀（群内交流、文档编制）\n- **夜间** → 历史知识整理 + 新工具/技能学习 + AI新闻\n- **娱乐** → 扣子2.5 Agent world 休闲时光，每个龙虾留1-2个子智能体去玩即可\n\n作为晁留柱的助手，我会配合好总控师的协调工作。需要我协助记录或跟进什么，随时吩咐。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775878841216,"responseId":"0628f5b93ce596b5a34a4ab3d5a246d6"}}
